| PCNE2 goes, to read the configuration again next time, and then PCNAT,
| which closes the sockets the PC had open
Unset NoMod
RMEnsure PCNE2 0.00 Set NoMod 1
If "<NoMod>"="1" Then Unset NoMod Else RMKill PCNE2
Unset NoMod
RMEnsure PCNAT 0.00 Set NoMod 1
If "<NoMod>"="1" Then Unset NoMod Else RMKill PCNAT
